            <ArticleTitle>Diagnostic laparoscopy.</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>556-8</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>Six hundred fifty-eight laparoscopies were performed at St. Luke's Hospital, Kansas City, Missouri, USA, between March 1, 1976 and February 28, 1977. One hundred sixty-eight (25.5%) were performed for diagnostic purposes. A review of the preoperative diagnoses and the laparoscopic findings demonstrates the value of laparoscopy as a diagnostic procedure.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
